---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHeader from '@components/structure/PageHeader.astro';
import ArticleFooter from '@components/structure/ArticleFooter.astro';
import Anchor from '@components/Anchor.astro';

const {
  title = 'Colophon',
  screen_title = 'Colophon',
  description = 'Detailed information about the technologies, tools, and design decisions used to build this site.',
} = Astro.props;
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <PageHeader screen_title={screen_title} />

  <section class="intro">
    <p class="lead">A colophon is a historical statement regarding the creation and technical specifications of a printed or digital medium. This page documents the tools, design choices, and infrastructure that bring this space to life.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="specs-group">
    <h2>Typography</h2>
    <p>Legibility and visual rhythm are paramount. The site relies on modern, screen-optimized typefaces:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Inter:</strong> Designed by Rasmus Andersson, this is the primary sans-serif font used across the UI for its excellent geometric readability.</li>
      <li><strong>Geist Mono:</strong> Created by Vercel, this is employed for code blocks and technical details, providing a clean, engineering-focused aesthetic.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="specs-group">
    <h2>Architecture & Stack</h2>
    <p>This site is built heavily around JAMstack principles, prioritizing speed, accessibility, and a clean file structure.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Framework:</strong> Built primarily with <Anchor variant="tui" href="https://astro.build" target="_blank">Astro</Anchor>, utilizing its islands architecture to deliver fast, static HTML.</li>
      <li><strong>Styling:</strong> Pure Vanilla CSS. All responsive design is handled via custom CSS variables without relying on heavy utility libraries.</li>
      <li><strong>Infrastructure:</strong> Domain management, routing, and deployments are hosted securely on the edge via <strong>Cloudflare Workers/Pages</strong>.</li>
    </ul>
    <a target="_blank" href="https://github.com/marcelrojas/www">Source</a>
  </section>

  <section class="specs-group">
    <h2>Software & Hardware Environment</h2>
    <p>The source code is written, debugged, and compiled using the following daily setup:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Editor:</strong> Developed by alternating between the raw speed of <strong>Vim</strong> within the Kitty terminal emulator, and the versatility of <strong>VS Code</strong> and <strong>Kate</strong>.</li>
      <li><strong>Operating System:</strong> Orchestrated natively on Linux. Primarily running <strong>Debian 13 "Trixie"</strong> with KDE Plasma environment, and <strong>Debian 12 "Bookworm"</strong> for lightweight legacy development.</li>
      <li><strong>Machines:</strong> Built across a desktop PC equipped with an Intel Celeron G1610 processor and 4GB of RAM, and a classic 32-bit IBM ThinkPad T42.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <ArticleFooter>
    <p>made with a lot of passion and love</p>

    <div class="signature">
      <span>Love,</span>
      <svg aria-hidden="true" aria-labelledby="signature-of-marcel-r" fill="none" height="49" role="img" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.25" viewBox="0 0 136 43" width="153" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <title id="signature-of-marcel-r">Signature of Marcel Rojas</title>
      </svg>
    </div>

  </ArticleFooter>
</Layout>

<style>
  .content {
    max-width: 720px;
    padding: 2rem 0;
  }

  .intro .lead {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .specs-group {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;

    & > h2 {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium);
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    & > p {
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    & > ul {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 1rem;

      & > li {
        background: var(--background-secondary);
        padding: 1.25rem;
        border: 1px solid var(--fill-border);
        line-height: 1.6;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
      }
    }
  }
</style>